WEBVTT

00:01:58.007 --> 00:02:00.044
where anybody would want to be.

00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:01.536
I'm by myself.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.704
I've got a little house
out in the country,

00:02:03.728 --> 00:02:09.656
and I think I'm on day 17
of no human contact

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.745
other than virtually,

00:02:11.769 --> 00:02:12.920
and I'm well.

00:02:12.944 --> 00:02:15.571
I'm not anybody you need
to be worrying about right now.

00:02:15.595 --> 00:02:16.745
So I'm good.

00:02:17.626 --> 00:02:18.777
CA: Wow.

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:22.515
Well, so in a way, you're having
a related experience

00:02:22.539 --> 00:02:24.160
to what so many people are having.

00:02:24.184 --> 00:02:26.745
I mean, these are days
of isolation for many people,

00:02:26.769 --> 00:02:32.325
and that brings with it
lots of difficult emotions, in a way.